// Cap error notifications
// You can get all these errors by typing "CAP_debugerror" in the console.
// Also, you can get a specific error by typing "CAP_debugerror 9" for example.
sg_err_title = Ascension Gates - Error
sg_err_html_t = Ascension Gates Error:
sg_err_n = Error
sg_err_02 = Ascension Gates is not installed correctly.<br>Please make sure all Ascension Gates parts are installed and no old CAP / CAP Enhanced / EAP code addons are installed at the same time.
sg_err_03 = The addon version file is corrupt!<br>Please reinstall Ascension Gates to restore 'lua/cap_ver.lua'.
sg_err_04 = An old Stargate pack is installed at the same time as Ascension Gates:%s<br><br>Nothing is broken. Ascension Gates already contains everything from CAP and CAP Enhanced, with many bugs fixed. But both packs use the same files and names, so with both installed it is random which version of a part runs, and that causes errors in both.<br><br>Please unsubscribe the old pack (link above) and restart the game. Until then Ascension Gates does not spawn anything. Your saves and dupes keep working: the parts kept their names.
sg_err_05 = Please subscribe to all required workshop items to ensure the addon functions properly.<br><br>Missing Addons:%s
sg_err_06 = Your Garry's Mod installation is outdated.<br>Please update to the latest version to ensure compatibility.
sg_err_07 = Wiremod cannot be found on your Garry's Mod installation.<br>Please make sure Wiremod is installed correctly.
sg_err_09 = [[
    Ascension Gates is not installed correctly.<br>Please make sure all Ascension Gates parts are installed and no old CAP / CAP Enhanced / EAP code addons are installed at the same time.
